+## Contratos Completos
+
+- **Tipos** (`lib/milon/types.ts`): `PushSubscriptionRow`, `DevicePushSubscription`, `RestPushScheduleStatus` (`agendado`|`enviado`|`cancelado`|`erro`), `RestPushScheduleRow`, `RestPushSchedule`, `UpsertPushSubscriptionInput`, `CreateRestPushScheduleInput` — field-by-field na §3.
+- **Repositório** (`IPushRepository` + `lib/milon/repositories/push.ts` + fake + barrel): `upsertSubscription(db, input, email)`, `createRestSchedule(db, input, email)`, `findRestScheduleById(db, scheduleId)`, `cancelRestSchedule(db, scheduleId, email) → boolean`, `markRestScheduleSent(db, scheduleId)`, `markRestScheduleFailed(db, scheduleId)`, `deleteSubscriptionByEndpoint(db, endpoint)` — assinaturas e semânticas exatas na §3; nenhuma operação usa `@supabase/*`.
+- **Rota** `POST /api/milon/rest-push`: corpo/respostas/validações/sleep/re-leitura na §3; dono exclusivamente da sessão; `maxDuration = 300`.
+- **Sender** `lib/milon/rest-push-sender.ts`: `getRestPushVapidDetails()`, `sendRestEndPush(subscription, payload)` com TTL 300 e payload congelado.
+- **Cliente** `lib/milon/rest-push-client.ts`: `ensureDeviceSubscription()`, `scheduleRestPush(input)`, `cancelRestPush(scheduleId)`, `urlBase64ToUint8Array(base64)`.
+- **Hooks**: `useRestTimer()` com `active`/`remainingSeconds`/`originWorkoutId`/`exerciseName`/`finished`/`start`/`cancel`/`dismiss` (duração capturada; start no-op sem `restSeconds > 0`; substituição cancela o agendamento anterior; falha de rede engolida); `usePushPermission()` com `supported`/`permission`/`isStandalone`/`isIOS`/`requesting`/`requestPermission`.
+- **Componentes**: `RestTimerPanel` e `RestPushEnableHint` com props e textos congelados na §3; `PwaRegistration` sem props; `WorkoutDetailSection` ganha `onSeriesMarked?: (info: RestMarkedInfo) => void` e `onExecutionCleared?: () => void` (demais props inalteradas: `workoutId`, `backTarget`, `title`, `headerActions`, `entryFooter`, `footer`, `executionEnabled`, `executionBlocked`, `activeExecutionWorkoutId`, `writeBlocked`, `blockedTooltip`, `onExecutionSettled`, `focusHeaderSignal`).
+- **Hook de execução**: `toggleSeries(entry, serie) → Promise<ToggleSeriesOutcome>` (`marked`|`unmarked`); todo o resto de `UseWorkoutExecutionReturn` inalterado.
+- **Regra pura**: `formatarContagemDescanso(segundos: number): string` → `mm:ss` com dois dígitos (ex.: 90 → `01:30`; 0 → `00:00`).
+- **PWA**: manifest e `sw.js` conforme a §3; layout com metadata/viewport e `PwaRegistration`.
